        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: David Draiman, Kip Winger, Dan Donegan, Mike Wengren, Steve \"Fuzz\" Kmak\n- Bands: Disturbed, Device, Winger\n- Songs: \"Stricken\"\n\nFacts:\n- Kip Winger was born as Charles Frederick Kip Winger on June 21, 1961.\n- David Draiman was born as David Michael Draiman on March 13, 1973.\n- Disturbed formed in 1996 when Dan Donegan, Mike Wengren, and Steve \"Fuzz\" Kmak hired vocalist David Draiman.\n- David Draiman is an American songwriter and the vocalist for Disturbed and Device.\n- Kip Winger is an American rock musician, a member of Winger, and a solo artist.\n- \"Stricken\" is a song by the American heavy metal band Disturbed.",
